WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.218
Tushpa, by Lake Van,
was the capital of Urartu.

2
00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:07.756
Its citadel crowned the Rock of Van.

3
00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:13.386
In 735 BC the Assyrian king
Tiglath-pileser III

4
00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:15.796
marched into the heart
of the kingdom.

5
00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:19.886
His inscriptions say he shut
King Sarduri II up in Tushpa

6
00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:22.888
and defeated him
before the city gates.

7
00:00:23.128 --> 00:00:25.838
Yet they do not claim
that the citadel fell,

8
00:00:25.878 --> 00:00:27.373
and it did not.

9
00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:30.142
Hold the royal road.

